{"title":"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Substitution_of_Differences)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Substitution of Differences)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d054dc8b366a8fcab4f1908771ea3a1edcfeaf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b &gt; c &gt; d$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a877074cb8bf510b3a1c2e048decfa993a4e8f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c + d = 2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7e6e937cae7004e83deab55b719fc6b6c69f28e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - b^2 + c^2 - d^2 = 2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />. Find the number of possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/379967ec041283f459810e8154ce9091dabbea30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010 = (a^2 - b^2) + (c^2 - d^2) = (a + b)(a - b) + (c + d)(c - d) \\ge a + b + c + d = 2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"667\" height=\"19\" />, where equality must hold so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/535ae82090ae816a48c234b86dd75808cd616fc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f60fde03b6bfeb6b8da8351396c0cad9381e478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = c - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />. Then we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/1/7e13bbad2ff2cb954f2ffa18f6836d0fad461496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1004$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> is maximal and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e99f347df4588f28885a44946247c777c2cd5c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 504$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> is minimal, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e44b7de8ba14e987cb94543781629818c089c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{501}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNote: We can also find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd24190a41180e1845248f668f72556b4512fde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> in another way. We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cfe86dbcdda231deef717b82dcb5e38cd2e82c1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{2} - b^{2} + c^{2} - d^{2}=(a+b)+(c+d) \\implies (a+b)(a-b)-(a+b)+(c+d)(c-d)-(c+d)=0 \\implies (a+b)(a-b-1)+(c+d)(c-d-1)=0\\]\" width=\"960\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/d/1bd53a77c8a5496d692ebaf4bc3367ac75e2029e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)(a-b-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/d/75d1a522d9d73fb0f4935c64c083d9b9f30d850c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c+d)(c-d-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced6b9b2e75857b566f1e516560c4a4d63977299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> because they are both non-negative if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29aefe6f89635924537ec2cbe613d79b335b2cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f32f47f3dc0d7636ab78ea46570ba2cde33532f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\geq d + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, which is the initial condition. Clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/d/5fd2f868a898bbce4b8c9cc87f06168d0bd88fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" /> since then one would be positive and negative, or both would be zero. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96ebcac93d59f79dd7c7261ad22d034996fa3f32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/0658e64502fd2d75b0be783786912a956c081364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Similarly, we can deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82a02999f12dc64baf90d1af825dc17e6d89b7b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=d+1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>~Edited by mathwizard123123\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/9/3197521069d117debac49e2d2040cc5949184536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1005$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, it follows that the only possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a697bfdeadf2105048670e6f6c7d4dc6878dc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (otherwise the quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a41d40caa0cad3f16867b1852dfa51172db1c78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - b^2$\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> would be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054090e60a5dcb8bc33213620b3af9278f9a3e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />). Therefore the only possible ordered pairs for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/3/b23cddc405e9673ea1267cdea1d59c76ffc6597a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(504, 503)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/3/7434f0afe9f5e8f44202707e3181cd1ece8fe757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(505, 504)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, ... , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/e/fbe7ba59a3cbb97dadc46bb92546c6c9382e1fba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1004, 1003)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, so  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e44b7de8ba14e987cb94543781629818c089c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{501}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" /> possible values. Hence the answer is 500+1=501\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Substitution_of_Differences.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Substitution_of_Differences)\">Solution 3 (Substitution of Differences)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Substitution of Differences)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/3170bafc1247397755e3c23a1444d8e8d577f7f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c068d788ef4b979eeb864d2fab25e213f8cf43e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = b-c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/8999dbb19e8c0fc4e1acb9d921f1ef34502e80c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = c-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/5/4451b0f7f01c5f96bf67aafdf38add9497b25e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b &gt; c &gt; d \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d20258310be3455daf8318274224a9d1d28fb6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y, z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"11\" /> are positive integers.\n</p><p>Rewrite the second equation using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdf5fbbb3dc0fc4bee681f57e65cb941fb83d0b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a8321eaef6ec411ee2e886c801e492e7ddfc5302.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^2 - d^2 = (c+d)(c-d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"21\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/1/9e15e8e246174b959e1219da63de83833570068d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(a+b) + z(c+d) = 2010\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/902f3cf146e2da2a20c72bfa9e5cdb49061bc1e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d = 2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" />, we can substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68eda0b6db90f3d3ccf3e698605e0a600bc60d7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+d = 2010 - (a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"20\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27a74727d7de438113bac70339ae4d818230ffc1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(a+b) + z(2010 - (a+b)) = 2010 \\implies (x-z)(a+b) = 2010(1-z)\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f77ffe5a58ad635ffcaf6358678729bf9e07e75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9e2754ba338709fff198e4e613488deb0f3c93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4d27f40ba14a007cf8e6c2dd795da88704242f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> is negative. For the LHS to be negative, we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1e262a6265f07a0e2dc67de73372358de2b376.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &gt; x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"10\" />. However, even at minimum values (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97ca90f4c6b8f2214d2793970ed001f062af6f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1, z=2, a+b=1007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"205\" height=\"18\" />), the magnitude of the LHS <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d19c2a1ed9812a5866d4a19fbd88ffc5f3c733e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|(1-2)1007|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> is far less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/5/66502305ebafa0193b9feb9f27d8d08f8193b360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2010(1-2)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/5990d6cf0dcf5df54109c8d7814b7b8676659cef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/5990d6cf0dcf5df54109c8d7814b7b8676659cef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, the RHS becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/799cf391e9f40a24b49a495b39f9fc3413cc0e5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/637bba8f41b57684f3d00abd1d0d96d026a4e477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-z = 0 \\implies x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2ea7581c87e299152333019e7f838260fcefbe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67f3a61c765bb12083fe6d6aaa5149b7f0049f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-d = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Finding the Range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd24190a41180e1845248f668f72556b4512fde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/756ef147c946f15543dd8dbae6e3352f642312dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=c-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> into the sum:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f21ba9685512fd55e659336cc0fe8d5b1e40d4a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a + 2c - 2 = 2010 \\implies a + c = 1006\\]\" width=\"298\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Using the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b97c9303c2dbe817031254c8f35787483e45d3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; a-1 &gt; c &gt; c-1 \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"205\" height=\"16\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55d1ffb9b2d61df8201c101899acb892fe9981f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-1 &gt; c \\implies a-1 &gt; 1006 - a \\implies 2a &gt; 1007 \\implies a \\ge 504$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"497\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b380c96ae45abb4e7e32043c843623160760f977.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-1 \\ge 1 \\implies 1006 - a \\ge 2 \\implies a \\le 1004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"345\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Total values = 1004 - 504 + 1 = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e44b7de8ba14e987cb94543781629818c089c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{501}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~LI,CHENXI\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I\" title=\"2010 AIME I\">2010 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title